	(text_box "Rev D Updates\n* All fast TX and RX GPIO are now on port D\n* Changed all RA connectors to vertical\n* Reduced PCB size to fit in smaller WTB\n* Added more capacitance to 5V rail\n* changed to smaller VTX boost and changed rail caps\n* Bigger PWR IN terminal block\n* added sensing to VTX\n* Changed RX input stage to increase common mode range and better common mode removal\n* moved RX stage selection header to allow bypassing of variable gain amp\n* added CAN transceiver for experimentation\n* Swapped a bunch of IO around to make routing easier. UPDATE FIRMWARE\n* Organized top level better\n* Changed to local power symbols on all subsheets\n* Added switchable attenuator to digital tx output\n\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 264.16 372.11 0)
		(size 107.95 34.6177)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a600a1b-e6aa-447f-9624-ef8647b49f75")
	)
